jatayu-update-manager (1.2.2~rc3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Detect safe upgrades including newly required kernel images.
  * Align update discovery, preview, and installation with --with-new-pkgs.
  * Keep --no-remove; never silently escalate to full-upgrade.
  * Improve accurate empty-state messages in English and Hindi.
  * Add regression tests for kernel updates and removal protection.

